OL,3,AColman's Mustard put up for sale ahead
OL,4,Aof merger
OL,5,
OL,6,FA famous mustard brand synonymous with
OL,7,FNorwich has been put up for sale.
OL,9,FColman's Mustard, which had a factory
OL,10,Fin Norwich for 160 years, has been put
OL,11,Fon the market ahead of a merger between
OL,12,FUnilever and American food giant
OL,13,FMcCormick in a deal believed to be
OL,14,Fworth #48bn.
OL,16,FThe company has been deeply rooted in
OL,17,FNorfolk after it was founded in 1814 by
OL,18,FJeremiah Colman at Stoke Holy Cross
OL,19,Fbefore production moved to Carrow in
OL,20,F1858.
OL,23,APub: 28-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB  BusinessC Nat TVF  Nat News
FL,117,105,200,300,0,100
