OL,3,AColman's Mustard put up for sale ahead
OL,4,Aof merger
OL,5,
OL,6,FA Unilever spokesperson said: "A
OL,7,Fdecision has been taken to market the
OL,8,FColman's brand and assets to potential
OL,9,Fbuyers in order to proactively seek to
OL,10,Faddress potential competition concerns
OL,11,Ffrom the planned combination of
OL,12,FUnilever Foods and McCormick."
